{"seq":3,"slug":"stream-and-async-iteration","title":"Stream 与异步迭代：处理异步产生的值序列","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-async-runtime/patterns/stream-and-async-iteration","wordCount":819,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"stream-与异步迭代-处理异步产生的值序列\">Stream 与异步迭代：处理异步产生的值序列</h1><p><code>Stream</code> 是 <code>Iterator</code> 的异步版本——它代表一个可以异步产生值的序列。从 TCP 字节流到事件总线、消息队列消费、分页 API 响应，Stream 是处理&quot;随时间到来的数据&quot;的核心抽象。与 <code>Future</code>（产生单个值）不同，<code>Stream</code> 可以产生零个或多个值，并在每次产生值时可能需要等待。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><code>Stream</code> 的 <code>poll_next</code> 返回 <code>Poll&lt;Option&lt;T&gt;&gt;</code>：<code>Ready(Some(v))</code> 表示有新值、<code>Ready(None)</code> 表示流结束、<code>Pending</code> 表示等待中。拉取模型（消费者主动调用 <code>next().await</code>）天然提供背压——消费者不调用则生产者不产出，无需额外的流量控制机制。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    P[生产者 yield item] --&gt;|有界 channel| Buffer[缓冲区 16]&#10;    Buffer --&gt;|背压:满时 send.await 阻塞| P&#10;    Buffer --&gt;|next 消费| C[消费者 next await]&#10;    C --&gt;|处理完才请求下一个| Buffer\">graph LR\n    P[生产者 yield item] --&gt;|有界 channel| Buffer[缓冲区 16]\n    Buffer --&gt;|背压:满时 send.await 阻塞| P\n    Buffer --&gt;|next 消费| C[消费者 next await]\n    C --&gt;|处理完才请求下一个| Buffer</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>创建方式</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>特性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>宏</td>\n<td><code>async_stream::stream!</code> 配合 <code>yield</code></td>\n<td>最易读，支持任意异步逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>包装器</td>\n<td><code>ReceiverStream</code>、<code>IntervalStream</code></td>\n<td>包装 Tokio 类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手写</td>\n<td><code>impl Stream for Struct</code></td>\n<td>最大灵活性，需处理 Pin</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组合</td>\n<td><code>stream::iter</code>、<code>stream::once</code></td>\n<td>从迭代器或单值创建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并发处理</td>\n<td><code>buffer_unordered(n)</code></td>\n<td>并发 poll n 个子 Future</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"stream-trait-的定义\">Stream Trait 的定义</h2><p><code>Stream</code> trait 定义在 <code>futures</code> crate 中（尚未进入 <code>std</code>）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"pub trait Stream {&#10;    type Item;&#10;&#10;    fn poll_next(&#10;        self: Pin&lt;&amp;mut Self&gt;,&#10;        cx: &amp;mut Context&lt;&#39;_&gt;,&#10;    ) -&gt; Poll&lt;Option&lt;Self::Item&gt;&gt;;&#10;&#10;    // 可选的优化：提示流剩余的元素数量&#10;    fn size_hint(&amp;self) -&gt; (usize, Option&lt;usize&gt;) {&#10;        (0, None)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>pub trait Stream {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    type Item;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn poll_next(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        self: Pin&#x3C;&#x26;mut Self>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        cx: &#x26;mut Context&#x3C;'_>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) -> Poll&#x3C;Option&#x3C;Self::Item>>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 可选的优化：提示流剩余的元素数量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn size_hint(&#x26;self) -> (usize, Option&#x3C;usize>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (0, None)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>poll_next</code> 的返回类型是 <code>Poll&lt;Option&lt;T&gt;&gt;</code>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>返回值</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Poll::Ready(Some(item))</code></td>\n<td>流产生了一个新值 <code>item</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Poll::Ready(None)</code></td>\n<td>流已结束，不会再产生值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Poll::Pending</code></td>\n<td>当前没有值，已注册 Waker，稍后通知</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"消费-stream-streamext\">消费 Stream：StreamExt</h2><p><code>StreamExt</code> trait（由 <code>futures</code> 或 <code>tokio-stream</code> 提供）为 Stream 添加了大量实用方法，类似于 <code>Iterator</code> 的适配器：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use futures::StreamExt;&#10;use tokio_stream::wrappers::ReceiverStream;&#10;&#10;async fn process_stream() {&#10;    let (tx, rx) = tokio::sync::mpsc::channel::&lt;i32&gt;(32);&#10;&#10;    // 将 mpsc Receiver 包装为 Stream&#10;    let stream = ReceiverStream::new(rx);&#10;&#10;    // 使用 StreamExt 的各种方法&#10;    stream&#10;        .filter(|&amp;x| futures::future::ready(x &gt; 0))   // 过滤负数&#10;        .map(|x| x * 2)                                 // 变换&#10;        .take(10)                                        // 只取前10个&#10;        .for_each(|x| async move {&#10;            println!(&quot;Got: {}&quot;, x);&#10;        })&#10;        .await;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use futures::StreamExt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use tokio_stream::wrappers::ReceiverStream;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn process_stream() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let (tx, rx) = tokio::sync::mpsc::channel::&#x3C;i32>(32);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 将 mpsc Receiver 包装为 Stream</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let stream = ReceiverStream::new(rx);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 使用 StreamExt 的各种方法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    stream</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .filter(|&#x26;x| futures::future::ready(x > 0))   // 过滤负数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .map(|x| x * 2)                                 // 变换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .take(10)                                        // 只取前10个</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .for_each(|x| async move {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            println!(\"Got: {}\", x);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>常用的 StreamExt 方法：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>类比 Iterator</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>map(f)</code></td>\n<td>变换每个元素</td>\n<td><code>Iterator::map</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>filter(pred)</code></td>\n<td>保留满足条件的元素</td>\n<td><code>Iterator::filter</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>take(n)</code></td>\n<td>只取前 n 个元素</td>\n<td><code>Iterator::take</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>take_while(pred)</code></td>\n<td>取直到条件不满足</td>\n<td><code>Iterator::take_while</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>skip(n)</code></td>\n<td>跳过前 n 个元素</td>\n<td><code>Iterator::skip</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>fold(init, f)</code></td>\n<td>聚合</td>\n<td><code>Iterator::fold</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>collect()</code></td>\n<td>收集到集合</td>\n<td><code>Iterator::collect</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>for_each(f)</code></td>\n<td>对每个元素执行异步操作</td>\n<td>无直接对应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>buffer_unordered(n)</code></td>\n<td>并发处理，不保序</td>\n<td>无直接对应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>buffered(n)</code></td>\n<td>并发处理，保序</td>\n<td>无直接对应</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"创建-stream\">创建 Stream</h2><h3 id=\"方式-1-实现-stream-trait\">方式 1：实现 Stream trait</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::pin::Pin;&#10;use std::task::{Context, Poll};&#10;use futures::Stream;&#10;&#10;struct CounterStream {&#10;    count: u32,&#10;    max: u32,&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl Stream for CounterStream {&#10;    type Item = u32;&#10;&#10;    fn poll_next(mut self: Pin&lt;&amp;mut Self&gt;, _cx: &amp;mut Context&lt;&#39;_&gt;) -&gt; Poll&lt;Option&lt;u32&gt;&gt; {&#10;        if self.count &gt;= self.max {&#10;            Poll::Ready(None)  // 流结束&#10;        } else {&#10;            self.count += 1;&#10;            Poll::Ready(Some(self.count))  // 同步产生值&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::pin::Pin;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::task::{Context, Poll};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use futures::Stream;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct CounterStream {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    count: u32,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    max: u32,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl Stream for CounterStream {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    type Item = u32;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn poll_next(mut self: Pin&#x3C;&#x26;mut Self>, _cx: &#x26;mut Context&#x3C;'_>) -> Poll&#x3C;Option&#x3C;u32>> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if self.count >= self.max {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Poll::Ready(None)  // 流结束</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        } else {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            self.count += 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Poll::Ready(Some(self.count))  // 同步产生值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"方式-2-async-stream-宏-推荐\">方式 2：async-stream 宏（推荐）</h3><p>手动实现 <code>Stream</code> trait 因为 <code>Pin</code> 和状态机的复杂性而较为繁琐。<code>async-stream</code> crate 提供了 <code>stream!</code> 宏，支持在 <code>async</code> 块中使用 <code>yield</code> 语法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use async_stream::stream;&#10;use futures::StreamExt;&#10;&#10;fn fibonacci_stream() -&gt; impl Stream&lt;Item = u64&gt; {&#10;    stream! {&#10;        let mut a = 0u64;&#10;        let mut b = 1u64;&#10;        loop {&#10;            yield a;  // 产生一个值，暂停直到消费者请求下一个&#10;            let c = a + b;&#10;            a = b;&#10;            b = c;&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;async fn demo() {&#10;    let mut s = fibonacci_stream();&#10;    while let Some(n) = s.next().await {&#10;        if n &gt; 1000 { break; }&#10;        println!(&quot;{}&quot;, n);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use async_stream::stream;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use futures::StreamExt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn fibonacci_stream() -> impl Stream&#x3C;Item = u64> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    stream! {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let mut a = 0u64;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let mut b = 1u64;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        loop {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            yield a;  // 产生一个值，暂停直到消费者请求下一个</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let c = a + b;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            a = b;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            b = c;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn demo() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut s = fibonacci_stream();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    while let Some(n) = s.next().await {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if n > 1000 { break; }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"{}\", n);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>stream!</code> 宏将 <code>yield</code> 脱糖为实现了 <code>Stream</code> trait 的状态机，原理与 <code>async/await</code> 脱糖类似。</p>\n<h3 id=\"方式-3-从现有类型创建-stream\">方式 3：从现有类型创建 Stream</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use tokio_stream::{self as stream, StreamExt};&#10;&#10;// 从迭代器创建&#10;let s = stream::iter(vec![1, 2, 3, 4, 5]);&#10;&#10;// 从 channel 创建&#10;let (tx, rx) = tokio::sync::mpsc::channel(16);&#10;let s = stream::wrappers::ReceiverStream::new(rx);&#10;&#10;// 定时 Stream&#10;let s = stream::wrappers::IntervalStream::new(tokio::time::interval(Duration::from_secs(1)));&#10;&#10;// 从单个值创建（只产生一个元素然后结束）&#10;let s = stream::once(async { fetch_data().await });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use tokio_stream::{self as stream, StreamExt};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 从迭代器创建</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let s = stream::iter(vec![1, 2, 3, 4, 5]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 从 channel 创建</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let (tx, rx) = tokio::sync::mpsc::channel(16);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let s = stream::wrappers::ReceiverStream::new(rx);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 定时 Stream</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let s = stream::wrappers::IntervalStream::new(tokio::time::interval(Duration::from_secs(1)));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 从单个值创建（只产生一个元素然后结束）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let s = stream::once(async { fetch_data().await });</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"背压机制\">背压机制</h2><p>背压（Backpressure）是防止生产者速度超过消费者处理速度的机制。Stream 通过 <code>poll_next</code> 的拉取模型自然实现背压：消费者不调用 <code>next()</code>，生产者就不会产生新值。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    Producer[生产者] --&gt;|&quot;yield item&quot;| Buffer[有界缓冲区]&#10;    Buffer --&gt;|&quot;next().await&quot;| Consumer[消费者]&#10;    Consumer --&gt;|背压信号(缓冲区满)| Producer\">graph LR\n    Producer[生产者] --&gt;|\"yield item\"| Buffer[有界缓冲区]\n    Buffer --&gt;|\"next().await\"| Consumer[消费者]\n    Consumer --&gt;|背压信号(缓冲区满)| Producer</pre><p>使用 <code>mpsc::channel</code> 时，有界 channel 天然提供背压：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// 缓冲区大小为 16，超过时 send 会 await&#10;let (tx, rx) = tokio::sync::mpsc::channel::&lt;Item&gt;(16);&#10;&#10;// 生产者：当 channel 满时，send().await 会阻塞&#10;tokio::spawn(async move {&#10;    for item in large_dataset {&#10;        tx.send(process(item)).await.unwrap();  // 背压点&#10;    }&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 消费者：控制处理速度&#10;let stream = ReceiverStream::new(rx);&#10;stream.for_each(|item| async { handle(item).await }).await;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 缓冲区大小为 16，超过时 send 会 await</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let (tx, rx) = tokio::sync::mpsc::channel::&#x3C;Item>(16);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 生产者：当 channel 满时，send().await 会阻塞</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tokio::spawn(async move {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for item in large_dataset {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        tx.send(process(item)).await.unwrap();  // 背压点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 消费者：控制处理速度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let stream = ReceiverStream::new(rx);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>stream.for_each(|item| async { handle(item).await }).await;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"并发流处理\">并发流处理</h2><p><code>buffer_unordered</code> 是并发处理 Stream 元素的利器：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use futures::StreamExt;&#10;&#10;async fn fetch_all_urls(urls: Vec&lt;String&gt;) -&gt; Vec&lt;String&gt; {&#10;    futures::stream::iter(urls)&#10;        .map(|url| async move {&#10;            reqwest::get(&amp;url).await.unwrap().text().await.unwrap()&#10;        })&#10;        // 最多 10 个并发 HTTP 请求&#10;        .buffer_unordered(10)&#10;        .collect::&lt;Vec&lt;_&gt;&gt;()&#10;        .await&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use futures::StreamExt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn fetch_all_urls(urls: Vec&#x3C;String>) -> Vec&#x3C;String> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    futures::stream::iter(urls)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .map(|url| async move {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            reqwest::get(&#x26;url).await.unwrap().text().await.unwrap()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 最多 10 个并发 HTTP 请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .buffer_unordered(10)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .collect::&#x3C;Vec&#x3C;_>>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .await</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>buffer_unordered(n)</code> 的行为：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>同时 poll 最多 <code>n</code> 个 Future</li>\n<li>哪个 Future 先完成，就先输出（不保序）</li>\n<li>适合延迟差异大的并发请求</li>\n</ul>\n<p><code>buffered(n)</code> 的行为：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>同时 poll 最多 <code>n</code> 个 Future</li>\n<li>按原始顺序输出（可能等待较慢的 Future）</li>\n<li>适合需要保序的场景</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"合并多个-stream\">合并多个 Stream</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use tokio_stream::StreamExt;&#10;use futures::stream::select_all;&#10;&#10;async fn merge_streams() {&#10;    let stream1 = make_stream_a();&#10;    let stream2 = make_stream_b();&#10;    let stream3 = make_stream_c();&#10;&#10;    // 合并：任一 stream 有值时产出&#10;    let mut merged = select_all(vec![&#10;        Box::pin(stream1) as Pin&lt;Box&lt;dyn Stream&lt;Item = _&gt;&gt;&gt;,&#10;        Box::pin(stream2),&#10;        Box::pin(stream3),&#10;    ]);&#10;&#10;    while let Some(item) = merged.next().await {&#10;        handle(item).await;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use tokio_stream::StreamExt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use futures::stream::select_all;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn merge_streams() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let stream1 = make_stream_a();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let stream2 = make_stream_b();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let stream3 = make_stream_c();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 合并：任一 stream 有值时产出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut merged = select_all(vec![</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Box::pin(stream1) as Pin&#x3C;Box&#x3C;dyn Stream&#x3C;Item = _>>>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Box::pin(stream2),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Box::pin(stream3),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    while let Some(item) = merged.next().await {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        handle(item).await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"在-for-循环中使用-stream\">在 for 循环中使用 Stream</h2><p>Rust 的 <code>for</code> 循环只支持同步 <code>Iterator</code>。要用 <code>for</code> 风格迭代 Stream，需要 <code>while let</code> 模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// 正确的 Stream 迭代&#10;let mut stream = make_stream();&#10;while let Some(item) = stream.next().await {&#10;    process(item).await;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 或使用 for_each&#10;make_stream()&#10;    .for_each(|item| async move { process(item).await })&#10;    .await;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 正确的 Stream 迭代</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let mut stream = make_stream();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>while let Some(item) = stream.next().await {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    process(item).await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 或使用 for_each</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>make_stream()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .for_each(|item| async move { process(item).await })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .await;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Rust 正在讨论异步 <code>for</code> 循环语法（<code>for await item in stream</code>），但截至 2026 年尚未稳定。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>参见本章节：<a href=\"structured-concurrency\">结构化并发</a> — Stream 与 JoinSet 结合的并发模式；<a href=\"cancellation-and-timeout\">取消与超时</a> — Stream 在超时时的取消行为。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p><code>Stream</code> 是 Rust 异步编程处理值序列的核心抽象，其 <code>poll_next</code> 设计与 <code>Future::poll</code> 一脉相承——拉取模型自然提供背压，<code>None</code> 信号流结束。<code>async-stream</code> 的 <code>stream!</code> 宏大幅降低了实现复杂 Stream 的难度。<code>buffer_unordered</code> 是并发处理 Stream 元素的标准工具，而 <code>mpsc::channel</code> 的有界缓冲区是防止生产者淹没消费者的实用机制。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Stream 与异步迭代：处理异步产生的值序列","id":"stream-与异步迭代-处理异步产生的值序列"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Stream Trait 的定义","id":"stream-trait-的定义"},{"level":2,"text":"消费 Stream：StreamExt","id":"消费-stream-streamext"},{"level":2,"text":"创建 Stream","id":"创建-stream"},{"level":3,"text":"方式 1：实现 Stream trait","id":"方式-1-实现-stream-trait"},{"level":3,"text":"方式 2：async-stream 宏（推荐）","id":"方式-2-async-stream-宏-推荐"},{"level":3,"text":"方式 3：从现有类型创建 Stream","id":"方式-3-从现有类型创建-stream"},{"level":2,"text":"背压机制","id":"背压机制"},{"level":2,"text":"并发流处理","id":"并发流处理"},{"level":2,"text":"合并多个 Stream","id":"合并多个-stream"},{"level":2,"text":"在 for 循环中使用 Stream","id":"在-for-循环中使用-stream"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"取消与超时：异步任务的生命周期终止","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-async-runtime/patterns/cancellation-and-timeout"},"next":{"title":"Pin 与自引用结构：固定内存位置的安全保证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-async-runtime/advanced/pin-and-self-referential"}}